The ECV implementation in R/x6_other_algos.R incorporates code derived from
randnet 1.0 by Tianxi Li, Elizaveta Levina, Ji Zhu, and Can M. Le. randnet is
distributed under GPL (>= 2). The corresponding upstream functions in
randnet/R/RCode.R are ECV.block(), holdout.evaluation.fast.all(),
iter.SVD.core.fast.all(), ECV.undirected.Rank(), and
missing.undirected.Rank.fast.all(). They correspond to the local ECV.BM(),
holdout.evaluation.fast.all(), iter.SVD.core.fast.all(), and the legacy routines
isolated inside ecv_stability_rdpg(). netOP changes the surrounding namespace
integration, validation, parallel orchestration, canonical loss names, and
public wrappers while preserving the underlying ECV mathematical procedures.

See inst/COPYRIGHTS for the file-level licensing and provenance inventory and
inst/CITATION for scholarly attribution.
